{
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Ability.Attack.Description": "A wide lunge or sweep with one of its massive pincers."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Ability.Attack.Name": "Pincer Strike"
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Ability.Grab.Description": "Snaps a pincer shut around you and hoists you into the air."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Ability.Grab.Name": "Pincer Grab"
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Ability.Hammer.Description": "A double pincer-strike out of a cloud of sand that can leave you stunned."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Ability.Hammer.Name": "Pincer Hammer"
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Ability.Idle.Description": "Circles you without attacking, recovering its breath."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Ability.Idle.Name": "Watch"
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Ability.Sand.Description": "Hurls a shovelful of sand to blind you, then follows up with a boulder."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Ability.Sand.Name": "Sand Throw"
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Ability.Scuttle.Description": "Retreats up the pit wall to open up the distance."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Ability.Scuttle.Name": "Scuttle Back"
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Ability.Slam.Description": "Brings the whole length of its tail down in a howling arc."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Ability.Slam.Name": "Tail Slam"
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Ability.Sting.Description": "Pins you down and drives its venomous stinger into you."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Ability.Sting.Name": "Sting"
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Ability.Trample.Description": "Charges right over you, each leg striking in turn."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Ability.Trample.Name": "Trample"
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Attack.Avoid.V0": "and you narrowly evade a jab aimed at your chest, the massive pincer furrowing the hard-packed sand before being yanked out again."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Attack.Avoid.V1": "but you're just far away enough to dodge it with a vigorous lunge backwards. A follow-up pounce you evade as well, and you weave yourself away from its snapping pincers."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Attack.Avoid.V2": "The scorpion lunges and launches its claw at you, but your reflexes save you the pain of being pounded to the ground, the strike shaking only the earth."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Attack.Avoid.V3": "but you react quickly and sprint to the side, out of the way as the plated beast tries to bury you."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Attack.Avoid.V4": "but you nimbly [if (singleleg) {slide|step}] to the side, a great gust of wind following in the wake of the strike."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Attack.Block.V0": "but you raise your [shield] just in time to block a pincer that would have otherwise hurt a good bit."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Attack.Block.V1": "and you grip your [shield] tight to absorb a massive impact that sends you across the sand, but you remain standing."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Attack.Block.V2": "The scorpion lunges, and you swiftly raise your [shield] above your head to deflect a strike that shakes the sand around you."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Attack.Block.V3": "and you ready your [shield] to weather the storm as it bowls into you, but nothing cracks your iron defense."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Attack.Block.V4": "but you catch the strike on your [shield] to deflect it away from you, leaving you unscathed."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Attack.Hit.V0": "jabbing you dead-on with one of its massive pincers, momentarily knocking the air out of your lungs."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Attack.Hit.V1": "catching you like a fly. You're scooped up and flung away, skidding painfully over the rough sand."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Attack.Hit.V2": "The scorpion's quick lunge into a strike catches you off-guard, and you cry out in pain as the titanic arachnid pummels you to the ground with its onyx claw."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Attack.Hit.V3": "sweeping you up and flipping you into the air, where a swift smack delivers you right back to the ground."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Attack.Hit.V4": "which feels like an entire brick wall slamming into you as the strike connects with your body."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Attack.Lead.V0": "The scorpion lunges forwards, "
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Attack.Lead.V1": "The scorpion launches its claw at you in a quick, wide-sweeping arc, "
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Attack.Lead.V2": ""
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Attack.Lead.V3": "The scorpion slams its pincers into the sand and surges towards you, "
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Attack.Lead.V4": "The scorpion skitters sideways and jabs at you, "
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Constrict.V0": "You wiggle and turn in the scorpion's grasp, but all you achieve is digging the pincer's edges deeper into you flesh."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Constrict.V1": "Violently struggling, you attempt to escape, but there is nothing you can do to move this mighty claw."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Constrict.V2": "You try to pry yourself out of the scorpion's vice-like claw, but your attempts seem to achieve nothing against its overpowering strength."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Constrict.V3": "The goliath's power seems frustratingly insurmountable as you struggle and fight against it, making no progress in freeing yourself."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Constrict.V4": "You punch and kick at the massive claw trapping you, but it continues to hold you tight."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Description": "You are fighting a colossal scorpion, clad in a carapace of ebony chitin and towering before you like a dark mountain. Its shovel-shaped claws are probably used to pulverize and dig through rocks and sand alike, but they are no doubt powerful enough to crush you--and most other living things in Mareth--as well. Eight sturdy legs ending in sharp tips equip the creature with excellent balance and mobility, and a long, segmented tail curved high over its thick, armored body poses yet another deadly threat, the stinger poised and ready to dispense its venomous load into anything unfortunate or slow enough.[pg]The arena at the bottom of this sandy pit is quite spacious, but the sheer size and speed of your opponent make it feel right claustrophobic. To complicate matters, the shifting sands underneath you give only dubious support, slowing down your movement."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Escape.Text": "As you fight this titanic pincer with all you have, something suddenly seems to give way. Seizing your chance, you push as hard as you can and wriggle, which eventually grants you enough leverage to pry yourself free with a mighty heave. Your enjoyment of the sand returning underneath your [if (singleleg) {[legs]|[feet]}] is short-lived however, as a sharp clicking announces another grab that you only dodge by a hair's breadth before you scramble away from the irritated beast. Once more, you turn and ready your [weapon]."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Fantasy.V0": "You imagine the massive onyx beast lying on its back for you, spreading its segmented legs in lustful invitation."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Fantasy.V1": "You try to think of all the ways you could use that long, thick tail to sate your lust. There are too many to choose."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Fantasy.V2": "Looking at those gigantic, pitch-black pincers really gets your juices flowing, your hands and groin itching to get a good feel of them."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Fantasy.V3": "You heard somewhere that scorpions 'dance' with one another as they mate. The sheer thought of you being this titanic obsidian beast's dancing partner fills you with a gentle warmth and lust for more."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Fantasy.V4": "You try to imagine what a wedding night with a scorpion would be like. The perverted possibilities and positions you come up with would even make a succubus blush."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Fantasy.V5": "That thick, onyx carapace looks too arousing for your dirty mind--you just have to imagine rubbing yourself all over it, naked, like the arachnophiliac slut you are"
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Fantasy.V5Suffix": ", and that's exactly what's happening"
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Grab.Avoid": "but you're already leaping to the side, and a mighty billow of sand rises up behind you. Having snapped its pincer into nothing but empty air, the gargantuan beast drags it back, clacking at you in indignation."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Grab.Hit": "snapping it shut around you and wrenching your body high into the air. You fail to escape as the world turns over--the titanic beast waves you from side to side, its chitin grip clamping down like an enormous, ever-tightening vice. You have to get out of this, fast!"
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Grab.Lead": "An alarming rattle comes from the scorpion as it takes a few scuttling steps, then swipes at you with a lightning-fast opened claw, "
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Grapple.V0": "The claw agonizingly tightens around you, holding you fast and secure in place as the scorpion rattles at you."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Grapple.V1": "It feels like you've being mangled by an enormous vice, the onyx pincer digging into your flesh with merciless strength."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Grapple.V2": "The gargantuan scorpion presses down on you, making you cry out in acute agony. It's going to crush you!"
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Grapple.V3": "The massive beast shakes you in its grasp, introducing a sickening sensation of vertigo to the pressing pain."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Grapple.V4": "Suddenly slamming you into the ground, the obsidian behemoth drags you across the sand, making you helplessly cry out and sputter as the myriad grains grate against you."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Grapple.V5": "The scorpion suddenly decides to take you on a round across the pit's wall, sweeping you about like a toy. You feel your insides churning in protest."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Grapple.V6": "You're lifted high, far above the vicious beast as it squeezes you, the scorpion regarding you with black, unblinking eyes."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Hammer.Avoid": "You dodge away on instinct, and fortunately so. Through the cloud, a claw immediately smashes down like a titan's sledge hammer, obliterating everything where you just stood."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Hammer.Block": "You grunt when, through the cloud, a claw immediately smashes down into your [shield] raised high, making you buckle under its titanic, earth-rumbling impact. But you hold steadfast."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Hammer.Hit": "And when you do see it, it's already too late; the onyx claw smashes down upon you like a titan-sized sledge hammer. It has the effect of one, too. Dazed, devoid of strength, and hoping you didn't break anything important, you struggle to stand up at all, let alone [if (!hasweapon) {raise|grab for}] your [weapon]."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Hammer.Lead": "A low rattle flows right into a rapid double pincer-strike at the ground that upsets your [if (singleleg) {stability|footing}] and whirls up a gust of sand. For a moment, you can't see anything. "
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Idle.V0": "The creature decides to simply regard you, keeping its tiny eyes on you as it skitters from side to side."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Idle.V1": "Slowly circling sideways, the massive beast keeps its pincers and tail-end pointed at you, but makes no move to attack."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Idle.V2": "The obsidian behemoth shuffles in place, clacking its claws in warning, but nothing more."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Idle.V3": "The massive pincers open wide, and you [if (hasshield) {lift your shield|get ready to dodge}], but they simply remain like that, in an obvious threat directed at you."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Idle.V4": "The titanic beast's many feet scrape across the ground, throwing up small clouds of sand as the scorpion skitters around a pillar."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Idle.V5": "In a sudden flurry of movement that jerks you to full alert, the gargantuan arachnid scurries across the wall of the pit, making a near-full circle around you before settling down again and continuing to stare at you."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Idle.V6": "Sitting perfectly still, the dark colossus seems content with not attacking, instead merely staring at you."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Idle.V7": "The great, obsidian titan swipes its claws across the ground, just out of your range, gathering a heap of sand for apparently no reason."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Idle.V8": "Rhythmically thumping the ground with its enormous pincers, the scorpion bares its mandibles and rattles them at you, though doesn't do anything further."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Name": "onyx scorpion"
  "Scenes.Scorpion.React.Bow.V0": "[pg-]The arrow glances off with a pitiful, wooden clank as it connects with the beast's carapace."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.React.Bow.V1": "[pg-]Your shot hits one of the arachnid's enormous obsidian plates, simply ricocheting off its natural armor."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.React.Bow.V2": "[pg-]You hit an armor plate, your shot bouncing off without doing even the slightest harm."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.React.Bow.V3": "[pg-]Raising a massive claw, the scorpion swiftly shields itself from your arrow, rendering your shot useless."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.React.Bow.V4": "[pg-]The scorpion jerks aside in a frightening, almost prophetic reflex. Your arrow impales itself into the sand behind it."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.React.Firearm.V0": "[pg-]Your shot glances off one of the scorpion's thick, chitinous plates, embedding itself into the sand."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.React.Firearm.V1": "[pg-]You miss its squishier parts by a hair, the bullet ricocheting off the onyx arachnid's natural armor. It's hissing, but uninjured."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.React.Firearm.V2": "[pg-]The gargantuan scorpion suddenly jerks downwards, angling its armor against you, and your bullet deflects off its back-carapace. It left nothing more than a smudge."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.React.Firearm.V3": "[pg-]With impressive speed, the arachnid raises one of its pincers to its face, just in time to deflect your bullet. An irritated rattling sound suggests it definitely felt the impact."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.React.Firearm.V4": "[pg-]The enormous beast tries to dodge to the side, but your shot still catches a rounded obsidian plate, whizzing off into the unknown. The scorpion seems agitated, but unhurt."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.React.Melee.V0": "[pg-]Your strike is met with nigh-impenetrable onyx armor, glancing off the thick plate without doing any harm."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.React.Melee.V1": "[pg-]Your attack is just slightly off, and you connect with the mighty beast's carapace, leaving nothing more than a scratch on the heavy chitin."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.React.Melee.V2": "[pg-]As you lunge forwards, the titan kicks up a billow of sand with its forelegs, throwing your aim off enough to make you miss your mark and skid off its heavy chitinous armor."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.React.Melee.V3": "[pg-]The massive goliath skitters backwards, raising its claws in a hurried block. The formidable pincers prove too thick to be damaged, and you bounce off its guard."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.React.Melee.V4": "[pg-]The beast suddenly strikes the ground before you, disrupting your attack with a titanic pincer in your way, your balance and momentum ruined."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.RunCheck.Climb": "You try to put some distance between you and the scorpion and hastily attempt to climb up the wall of this pit, hands grasping for purchase wherever they can. Before you can get far however, the massive creature is upon you. It rakes one of its claws across the sand to pick you off and toss you against an obelisk, where you slide down in a pained heap, cursing your own decisions."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.RunCheck.Sorrow": "[pg]Perhaps you shouldn't have tried that."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.RunCheck.Wings": "You beat your wings, trying to take off and escape this scorpion-pit, but they're sore and heavy with sand. Before you can even gain any significant height, the massive creature whips its tail and slams it into you, swatting you out of the air like a mere pesky [if (silly) {moth|fly}]. You crash hard onto the ground and skid several paces before you're stopped by one of the sandstone obelisks."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Sand.Avoid": "The billowing wave engulfs you, but before you can even think to shield your eyes, a large boulder of something barrels you down, knocking you right [if (singleleg) {to the ground|off your feet}]. It shatters from the impact, only to bury you under broken rocks and suffocating sand. You fight yourself free, sputtering and barely able to see anything."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Sand.Block": "You cover yourself with your [shield], feeling a large chunk of something barrel into you that shatters upon impact but leaves you unscathed."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Sand.Hit": "The billowing wave engulfs you, stinging your eyes, getting into [if (!isnaked) {your [armor]|places it really shouldn't be}], and robbing you of your orientation, but you do manage to dodge the worst: a large chunk, more a like boulder, rumbles past to shatter against one of the sandstone pillars."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Sand.Lead": "Ramming its pincers down, the towering behemoth unearths a deep shovelful of sand and hurls it towards you. "
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Scuttle.Text": "Rattling at you in aggravation, the scorpion scurries backwards and partially along the hole's high wall, putting some considerable distance between you as it circles the arena with raised claws."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Slam.Avoid": "The slam tears into the ground, sand spewing up like a volcano around it, but you remain unharmed. It missed, thankfully, and the scorpion quickly realizes that fact, withdrawing the appendage like a snake while sounding a slow, snapping rattle. It then circles you from afar, keeping its eyes on you."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Slam.Block": "The slam connects with your [shield], its sheer momentum so great that you're still forced to get out of there, or be maimed under who knows how many tonnes of chitin. You're thankfully granted a few moments to treat your stinging eyes and muscles while the scorpion retracts its appendage like a snake. It then circles you from afar, watching."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Slam.Hit": "It slams right into you, maiming you with a force that tears the ground you're being flattened against. You thank whatever compels the scorpion to drag its appendage back like a snake and give you the time you need to gather yourself again. It's simply circling you from afar, watching."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Slam.Lead": "The beast skitters up the wall, and a slight turn of its colossal body as its pincers anchor themselves is all the warning you get before the entire length of the its tail comes whipping down in a howling arc of black obsidian. "
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Sting.Avoid": "impales itself into the ground. You got out in the nick of time, but a second strike is right on the heels of the first, not allowing you a single heartbeat of inattention until you're out of the beast's effective skewering range."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Sting.Block": "impacts a [shield] that you managed to raise at just the last moment. Another venomous strike plummets into your guard, but you hold on and safely back out of the tail's effective thrusting range."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Sting.Hit": "catches you, tearing your flesh while you try to distance yourself as far as you can. Agony jolts through you with every motion, and a sinking, sapping sensation joins the warm blood running down your body, your mind and vision quickly descending into a roiling mess. [b:You must have been poisoned!]"
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Sting.Lead": "In one great pounce, the mountainous arachnid is upon you, shattering your balance with a swift strike and pinning you to the ground, its tail looming over you. You only have a few split-seconds to struggle free and roll away before the plunging stinger "
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Tease.V0": "The gargantuan scorpion seems entirely unaffected by your display."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Tease.V1": "The towering arachnid shows no interest in your sexual advances."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Tease.V2": "It appears you have no effect whatsoever on the mighty onyx beast."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Tease.V3": "Your teasing seems ineffective, the scorpion not reacting to any of it."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Tease.V4": "The arachnid observes you with its tiny, black eyes, but nothing hints at you having affected it in the slightest."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Tease.V5": "You observe no visible effects that your teasing could have had."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Tease.V6": "By the looks of it, the scorpion doesn't even understand what you're trying to do."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Trample.Avoid.V0": "but you do manage to duck under the pincers, prostrating yourself low to the ground."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Trample.Avoid.V1": "[pg-]You roll away to avoid its first leg squashing you."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Trample.Avoid.V2": "[pg-]You jerk your arm out of harm's way before it gets mutilated by another leg."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Trample.Avoid.V3": "[pg-]You escape the third leg crushing your hips by mere luck."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Trample.Avoid.V4": "[pg-]You predict where the fourth leg will hit, staying safe where you are."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Trample.Avoid.V5": "[pg-]You successfully shield yourself from its massive, dragging tail and wait for a few moments longer until it has fully passed over you before you rise again, shake yourself off, and face the beast."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Trample.End": "[pg-]It half-hangs from the far obelisk, observing you while it clicks its pincers."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Trample.Hit.V0": "and the pincers catch you right-on to pummel you to the ground."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Trample.Hit.V1": "[pg-]The first leg steps right on top of you and squeezes the air out of your lungs."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Trample.Hit.V2": "[pg-]Its second leg painfully pins your shoulder, its colossal weight stabbing into you."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Trample.Hit.V3": "[pg-]A tortured cry escapes you when its third leg digs into your hips and threatens to crush them. "
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Trample.Hit.V4": "[pg-]The fourth leg gores you in the gut as you try to get out, compressing your organs in ways they aren't supposed to be."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Trample.Hit.V5": "[pg-]Its massive tail, dragging behind, clobbers your head as it draws over you, pressing you right back into the sand for a few humiliating moments longer before you can pull yourself upright again and face the beast."
  "Scenes.Scorpion.Trample.Lead": "Its claws linked in front of itself like an impenetrable shield, the titanic arachnid comes charging at you with the might of a great tide. You have neither time nor space to get away, "
}
